## Core Files

- [LLM-friendly site index]({{ site.url }}/llms.txt): This file; a concise map of the archive and machine-readable entry points.
- [Programmatic archive index]({{ site.url }}/archive.json): JSON metadata for every issue, including issue numbers, dates, descriptions, markdown URLs, domains, and curated-link counts.
- [Human archive index]({{ site.url }}/archive/): Browser-facing archive grouped by year.
- [Latest issue markdown]({{ site.url }}/archive/{{ latestIssue.data.number }}.txt): Clean markdown for the most recent issue, without site chrome.
- [Latest issue HTML]({{ site.url }}/archive/{{ latestIssue.data.number }}/): Browser-facing version of the most recent issue.
- [Atom feed]({{ site.url }}/feed.xml): Feed of all issues.
- [Full-text search]({{ site.url }}/search/): Browser-facing search powered by Pagefind.

Use `/archive/N/` for per-issue HTML, `/archive/N.txt` for clean per-issue markdown, and `/archive/N/links.xml` for the Atom feed of curated links from one issue. Replace `N` with an issue number such as `{{ latestIssue.data.number }}`. Some special issues use suffixed identifiers such as `140-special`.

